            {
                "entry_id": "f57d97db-3fa3-313b-906e-26ee9dd7e78f",
                "word": "lance-flamme",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "5be2a05f-0dd7-42b6-b873-e9c93596cfce",
                        "entry_id": "f57d97db-3fa3-313b-906e-26ee9dd7e78f",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "lance-flammes"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "e1f7e461-2dd9-4776-be8c-6356f0fc8207",
                        "entry_id": "f57d97db-3fa3-313b-906e-26ee9dd7e78f",
                        "tags": [
                            "orthographe traditionnelle"
                        ],
                        "form": "lance-flammes"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f4ea5ec3-2ef7-3daf-8fd8-77de10c8e3e5",
                        "entry_id": "f57d97db-3fa3-313b-906e-26ee9dd7e78f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Arme conçue pour projeter un liquide enflammé."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Armement"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ff667119-157e-49d7-b37a-a86b64b96290",
                                "sense_id": "f4ea5ec3-2ef7-3daf-8fd8-77de10c8e3e5",
                                "text": "Depuis que j’avais vu, à seize ans, les statues de cendre laissées par la division SS qui avait brûlé au lance-flamme les habitants d’Oradour-sur-Glane, ces statues de cendre étaient tellement éphémères que lorsqu’on les touchait, elles s’effondraient et ne laissaient, sur le sol, qu’un tas de poussière grise."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9f128d4a-dcb6-44ea-84d5-adabd253b3e6",
                                "sense_id": "f4ea5ec3-2ef7-3daf-8fd8-77de10c8e3e5",
                                "text": "[…]; au sud, la 127ᵉ D.I. qui devra marcher sur le Panthéon et la Malmaison, par la Cour Soupir, Ostel, la ferme Gerlaux et la ferme d’Hameret. Ces divisions, dont l'attention est attirée sur l'existence de nombreuses creutes dans sa zone d'action, est pourvue d'une compagnie de lance-flammes."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "45817944-bf94-4517-8ece-b7dd79453200",
                        "source_entry_id": "f57d97db-3fa3-313b-906e-26ee9dd7e78f",
                        "source_sense_id": "f4ea5ec3-2ef7-3daf-8fd8-77de10c8e3e5",
                        "source_sense_description": "(Militaire) Arme projetant un liquide enflammé",
                        "target_lang_word": "Flammenwerfer",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Flammenwerfer",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b39c4c65-0fe9-3ec8-bdf7-aedcddf8718f",
                                        "entry_id": "70db6dc4-fa36-3a06-a51f-8cf356670978",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Waffe, die brennende Flüssigkeit oder Gas ausstößt"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7750e2f4-f249-451c-8c34-758a7286d8d0",
                                                "sense_id": "b39c4c65-0fe9-3ec8-bdf7-aedcddf8718f",
                                                "text": "Der Tank eines Flammenwerfers ist sein größter Schwachpunkt."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1866fe2e-49ac-4009-87a3-5d199d670ae9",
                                                "sense_id": "b39c4c65-0fe9-3ec8-bdf7-aedcddf8718f",
                                                "text": "„Die sowjetischen Soldaten machten ihnen mit Flammenwerfern den Garaus.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fb2c5c71-5186-478a-a0c5-bba57e56d6bf",
                                                "sense_id": "b39c4c65-0fe9-3ec8-bdf7-aedcddf8718f",
                                                "text": "„Sie enthielt sechs engbeschriebene Listen sowie neue Konstruktionspläne von schweren Panzern, Flammenwerfern und einem Jagdbomber.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b2726339-e75b-4922-a6b3-7c589f1dd98f",
                                                "sense_id": "b39c4c65-0fe9-3ec8-bdf7-aedcddf8718f",
                                                "text": "„Adam sah, wie der Unbekannte einen Flammenwerfer auf ihn richtete und griff sofort automatisch nach seiner Huxdane-Halley-Granate (zur Aussaat von Lepra-Bazillen), und in dieser Haltung gegenseitigen Argwohns gingen sie aufeinander zu.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "55b9cca5-bb6f-345f-8e17-cb25e8a7b81b",
                                        "entry_id": "70db6dc4-fa36-3a06-a51f-8cf356670978",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Feuerzeug/Einwegfeuerzeug (das eine größere Flamme als normal zu erwarten produziert)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "humorous"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e6bc794e-e6c2-47ff-91c3-1156a48be13a",
                                                "sense_id": "55b9cca5-bb6f-345f-8e17-cb25e8a7b81b",
                                                "text": "„Gerade will ich mir eine Lulle zwischen die Zähne klemmen – ich rauche nur kastrierte –, da fällt mir ein, Felix, du hast ja deinen Flammenwerfer vergessen.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f07617e1-1df7-4b3c-8f40-502a80c0b535",
                        "source_entry_id": "f57d97db-3fa3-313b-906e-26ee9dd7e78f",
                        "source_sense_id": "f4ea5ec3-2ef7-3daf-8fd8-77de10c8e3e5",
                        "source_sense_description": "(Militaire) Arme projetant un liquide enflammé",
                        "target_lang_word": "flamethrower",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "flamethrower",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "adb43f75-f6c8-37d3-b0f9-e6fa473453a0",
                                        "entry_id": "f1bc0989-a7b3-3e71-9883-f2a615409f9f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A device that projects a flame for starting fires, and sometimes also additional fuel to help ignition. Used either as a weapon or a tool."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b64cf755-7ff4-3f27-b7d9-9876c6ad8567",
                                        "entry_id": "f1bc0989-a7b3-3e71-9883-f2a615409f9f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Someone who is extremely good at throwing or shooting balls."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "33b9e95f-61ab-41d8-96aa-405fd1f2ee7f",
                                                "sense_id": "b64cf755-7ff4-3f27-b7d9-9876c6ad8567",
                                                "text": "\"We allowed him to kind of orchestrate the whole offense, and he got comfortable early,\" George said. \"He's a flamethrower. Once he gets hot, it's over.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cc42d412-9704-4038-9532-4eca0b4458ae",
                                                "sense_id": "b64cf755-7ff4-3f27-b7d9-9876c6ad8567",
                                                "text": "So when we see guys like that open, we gotta give them the ball. Especially Bryn [Forbes], he's a flamethrower. The guy is one of the best shooters I've been around, so to have him going in the game, it's much needed for us. We need him to get going. We need him to hit shots."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0df79821-8ba8-4e42-8f75-6e9bcf3ae3c6",
                                                "sense_id": "b64cf755-7ff4-3f27-b7d9-9876c6ad8567",
                                                "text": "Unlike steroids, these supposedly illegal substances were not used in secret. There was an understanding that it was in everyone's best interest — pitchers and hitters alike — for today's flamethrowers to have a good grip on the ball."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
